# Public documentation only. Source repositories, datasets, binaries, local
# configuration, credentials, editor files, caches, and temporary files stay out.
*
!.gitignore
!SKILL.md
!README.md
!LICENSE
!references/
!references/*.md
!evals/
!evals/*.md

# Defense in depth for accidentally named local Markdown documents.
references/private*
references/local*
references/secrets*
references/*~
evals/private*
evals/local*
evals/secrets*
evals/*~
